AUDIO: 'sampler. Strength is set to one by default, which is the intended sweet spot. If you find the effect too punchy or stylized for your particular scene, dial it back to 0.6 or 0.8. I personally find one works best for'

[04:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
